What is a Site Column?
x
A Site Column is a reusable column created at the SharePoint Site level, so you can reuse the same field in multiple Lists, 
Libraries, and Content Types.

Example: create these once:
    Department
    Customer
    Contract Number
    Start Date
    Status
Then reuse:
Site Column: Department
→ Contract Content Type
 → Invoice Content Type
 → Budget Request Content Type
 → Employee List

Instead of creating a new Department column separately everywhere.
